>1) What, in your opinion would be the best artifact weapon to use with the
>Valkyrie.  In my present game I  used a wish to obtain Gauntlets of power,
>so my Str is now 25. I have also offered sacrifices to my god Odin and have
>obtained the WarHammer Mjolnir.  Is this in fact the best thing for my
>Valkyrie to do? Are the better and more powerful options for her?

Well, it's more a matter of what you've got than what you might have. Mojo
is certainly crunchy enough that you don't _need_ anything else, but I
prefer to have another decent melee weapon so that I can throw Mojo with
impunity - a devastatingly powerful attack, and the thing that really sets
Valks apart from other combat wombats - and tackle shock-resistant
creatures.

As a rule of thumb, any artifact weapon that names a specific kind of
monster - Ogresmasher, frex - is no good; any other is generally useful.

